msgid "Allowed (GLPI default behavior)"
msgstr "Dibenarkan (tingkah laku lalai GLPI)"

msgid "Block solution approval when there is a comment"
msgstr "Sekat kelulusan penyelesaian apabila terdapat komen"

msgid "Comments during solution approval"
msgstr "Komen semasa kelulusan penyelesaian"

msgid "Configuration saved successfully."
msgstr "Konfigurasi berjaya disimpan."

msgid "Error saving configuration."
msgstr "Ralat semasa menyimpan konfigurasi."

msgid ""
"It is not allowed to enter comments when approving a solution. Please leave "
"the text box empty or refuse the solution."
msgstr ""
"Ia tidak dibenarkan untuk memasukkan komen semasa meluluskan penyelesaian. "
"Sila biarkan kotak teks kosong atau tolak penyelesaian."

msgid "Show warning to the user, allowing the solution approval"
msgstr "Tunjukkan amaran kepada pengguna, membenarkan kelulusan"

msgid "Solution Approval Guard"
msgstr "Pengawal Kelulusan Penyelesaian"

msgid "Solution Approval Settings"
msgstr "Tetapan Kelulusan Penyelesaian"

msgid "Solution approved"
msgstr "Penyelesaian diluluskan"

msgid ""
"Warning: Your solution was approved, but to report pending issues you must "
"refuse the solution or open a new ticket."
msgstr ""
"Amaran: Penyelesaian anda telah diluluskan, tetapi untuk melaporkan isu yang"
" belum selesai anda mesti menolak penyelesaian atau membuka tiket baharu."
